Allowed:
- Use the mod for free in Farming Simulator 25, single player, multiplayer and on servers.
- Look at the code and learn from it.
- Link to the official page: https://github.com/Toneslin-incarna-gaming/FS25_AutoDriveRouteBuilder
- Show the mod in videos and streams.

Not allowed without written permission from Toneslin:
- Upload or share the mod or parts of it on other sites.
- Sell the mod or put it behind a paywall.
- Publish changed versions.
- Present the mod as your own work.

The mod is provided as is, without warranty. Toneslin is not liable for any damage,
e.g. to savegames or AutoDrive routes. Please make a backup first.
